/**
 * Procedural 32x32 pixel-art sprite generator for the RogueLike Dungeon Game.
 * Generates raw 32x32 RGBA pixel buffers (testable in Node) and caches HTMLCanvasElement
 * sprites in the browser for crisp nearest-neighbor scaling at any adjustable tileSize.
 */

